 166:     "sections": "10.10.4.4-10.10.4.5",
 167:     "verbatim": (
 168:         "'When there are only two or three studies, we advise review authors to "
 169:         "undertake a sensitivity analysis to compare results from the different "
 170:         "methods.'"),
 171:     "decision": (
